{"title":"2026 AMC 8 Regional Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_8\">Problem 8</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Regional_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 8\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the AI Club at Silicon Valley Middle School, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/c/e7cee4c1bc083c3979f7ac19ac9f8646a3d0a29e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" /> of the members have used OpenAI, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/1/e1150a17bf1b733cb666be84d920c71fc96bb3f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"11\" height=\"38\" /> of the members have used DeepSeek. The entire club rounded up a total trip to Google in a shuttle bus with a maximum capacity of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/9/339baf6df71777af266e6259546917b0742caf2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$65$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> passengers. How many students are in the AI Club in total?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/4/e64e16736795443eb0be3ebc777b33e325027193.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 36\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 44\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 48\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 54\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 72$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"397\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Regional_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> be the total number of students in the AI Club. Since the number of students who used OpenAI is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/9/b5926f07bc79ba3027455459884fe0a25b670f17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{9}N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"31\" height=\"38\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> must be a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Similarly, because the number of students who used DeepSeek is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/b/0cbccb7784a568681d52c62a77b3c551d80d82f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{4}N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"31\" height=\"38\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> must also be a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> to be a multiple of both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, it must be a multiple of their least common multiple, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/6/56603b88e7c12bddd061a91c9c4a8c8823997b04.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{lcm}(4,9) = 36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"110\" height=\"20\" />. We are told that the entire club fits inside a shuttle bus with a maximum capacity of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/9/339baf6df71777af266e6259546917b0742caf2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$65$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> passengers, meaning <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/c/eac822213d970c2f80807fc85a8651ca01750017.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N \\le 65$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"61\" height=\"17\" />. The only positive multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce5d3cbb9ab0a992ed503c2d4499e4f4af2f9d65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> that satisfies this condition is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce5d3cbb9ab0a992ed503c2d4499e4f4af2f9d65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> itself.\n</p><p>The correct answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/2/dc27c5358070a1108897f73606c22116221b99d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ 36}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"66\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~Icosahedron0288\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Regional_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Regional_Problems\" title=\"2026 AMC 8 Regional Problems\">2026 AMC 8 Regional Problems</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017164640\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.030 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 108/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3569/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37397:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017164640 and revision id 291905. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}